app ui-minigolf-board "1.0.0"
"MinigolfBoard — isometric 3-hole putt-putt course: d-pad/keyboard putts roll the ball until blocked, tracks strokes vs par."
;; @capabilities "isometric mini-golf putting, ball roll physics, stroke count vs par, 3-hole course"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the GOLFER on a 3-hole putt-putt course. Statuses below are
;; from the Gate-4 catalog playthrough (2026-07-31): standalone playground,
;; live browser, events driven via the verification bridge + real DOM clicks,
;; evidence from drawables / HUD DOM / eventLog; one screenshot per story in
;; docs/runtime-verification-screenshots/gate4-ui-minigolf-board/.
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a grid putt-putt player expects — Golf Peaks style): each
;; hole is a small walled isometric course, tee to cup. There is no power
;; meter: you pick one of four directions (arrow keys / WASD / on-screen
;; d-pad) and the ball rolls in a straight line until a wall stops it. Every
;; putt costs one stroke — even a whiff straight into a wall. The puzzle is
;; reading the corridor: walls are the only brakes, so you bank the ball off
;; them to reach the cup in as few strokes as possible. Par is the yardstick.
;; A round looks like: read the hole -> putt a direction -> the ball rolls to
;; its resting cell -> Strokes +1 -> repeat -> the ball comes to rest on the
;; cup -> HOLE COMPLETE card (under / even / over par, strokes banked into
;; Total) -> Next Hole -> after hole 3, COURSE COMPLETE with your Total vs
;; the course par (3+4+5=12; the lines allow 1+2+4=7) -> Play Again.
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; GOLFER — "I read each hole, bank the ball off the walls, and beat par."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see hole 1 framed on screen — full-cell
;;      isometric terrain with no gaps (rough wall blocks around a fairway
;;      corridor), the ball on the tee at (1,3), the cup visible at (6,3),
;;      the HUD reading Hole 1 / Strokes 0 / Par 3 / Total 0, and a d-pad
;;      under the board.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live: HUD reads Hole 1 / Strokes 0 /
;;        Par 3 / Total 0, ball sprite painted at (1,3), 48 terrain sprites
;;        (rough walls around the row-3 fairway corridor, tee, cup), d-pad
;;        key-prompt imgs in the DOM under the board, zero asset failures.
;;        Screenshot story-1-hole1-initial.png.
;;   2. I putt a direction and the ball rolls in a straight line until a
;;      wall stops it — one stroke, whether it travelled one cell or five.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live on hole 2: PUTT_RIGHT from the tee
;;        (1,1) rolled the ball to (4,1) and stopped it against the (5,1)
;;        wall — one stroke, NO HOLE_IN — then PUTT_DOWN rolled it down the
;;        corridor into the cup (4,4). Exactly one stroke per direction
;;        press regardless of distance. Screenshot story-2-ball-rolled-to-wall.png.
;;   3. A putt straight into a wall is a whiff: the ball does not move and
;;      the stroke still counts. That is the sport — every direction press
;;      is a committed stroke.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live on hole 1: PUTT_UP from the tee
;;        (1,3) — walled on three sides — left the ball at (1,3), bumped
;;        Strokes 0 -> 1, and emitted no HOLE_IN. The whiff costs a stroke.
;;        Screenshot story-3-whiff.png.
;;   4. When the ball's resting cell is the cup, the hole is sunk: HOLE_IN
;;      fires, my strokes bank into Total, and the HOLE COMPLETE card tells
;;      me under / even / over par.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live: d-pad right-click from the tee
;;        rolled the ball onto the cup (6,3), the eventLog shows HOLE_IN
;;        (self-emit + client bus relay back into the trait — the relay
;;        works in the real app), and the HOLE 1 COMPLETE card rendered in
;;        the DOM reading "1 under par" (2 strokes vs par 3) with Total
;;        banked to 2. Screenshot story-4-hole-complete-card.png.
;;   5. Once the card is up the board is frozen — putts are dead until I
;;      choose Next Hole or Reset.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live with the HOLE 1 COMPLETE card up:
;;        PUTT_LEFT via the bridge plus a d-pad up click changed nothing —
;;        Strokes stayed 2, ball stayed on the cup (6,3), no HOLE_IN, card
;;        still rendered. Screenshot story-5-frozen-card.png.
;;   6. Next Hole loads the next course: new layout, ball on the new tee,
;;      Strokes back to 0, Par updated, Total and course-par kept.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live: clicking the card's "Next Hole"
;;        button (real DOM click) loaded hole 2 — HUD Hole 2 / Strokes 0 /
;;        Par 4 / Total 2 (kept), ball reseeded to the new tee (1,1), card
;;        gone; the same click later advanced hole 2 -> 3 (Par 5, ball
;;        (0,0), Total 4 kept). Screenshot story-6-hole2-loaded.png.
;;   7. Sinking hole 3 ends the round: the COURSE COMPLETE card reads my
;;      Total against the course par (12).
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live: hole 3 played its authored line
;;        (R -> (3,0), D -> (3,2), R -> (5,2), D -> cup (5,4)), the final
;;        putt emitted HOLE_IN, and the COURSE COMPLETE card rendered
;;        "4 under par" — Total 8 (2+2+4) vs course par 12 — with a single
;;        Play Again option. Screenshot story-7-course-complete.png.
;;   8. Play Again resets the round: hole 1, Strokes 0, Total 0, ball back
;;      on the first tee — and the course plays again.
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live: clicking "Play Again" on the
;;        COURSE COMPLETE card reset to HUD Hole 1 / Strokes 0 / Par 3 /
;;        Total 0 with the ball back on the (1,3) tee, and an immediate
;;        PUTT_RIGHT sank hole 1 again — the course replays.
;;        Screenshot story-8-play-again-reset.png.
;;   9. The ball reads alive: a 4-frame breathing idle (squash/stretch
;;      anchored at the feet, cycled at 300ms/frame by the renderTick frame
;;      counter), a 2-frame roll wobble for ~600ms after each putt, then
;;      back to idle — and no leftover tactics chrome (the NaN health-bar
;;      draw-shape layers, which divided the ball's missing health/maxHealth,
;;      were removed).
;;        PASS (Gate 4, 2026-07-31). Live paint sampling (50ms in-page on
;;        getLastDrawables): at rest the ball sprite URL cycles
;;        ball.idle-<0..3>.svg in ascending cyclic order (~300ms/frame
;;        nominal; headless rAF drops intermediate paints but order holds);
;;        a putt flips the sprite to ball.walk-<0|1>.svg for a ~0.8s window
;;        (6 ticks nominal, jank-aliased), then back to idle. No NaN
;;        health-bar draw-shape layers remain.
;;        Screenshot story-9-animation-idle.png.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/, generated by
;; tools/asset-workflow svg-generate from the sibling .md specs, golf art
;; hand-finished on top of the generator baseline)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/{fairway,hole,rough,tee}.svg — full-cell iso cubes;
;;             rough is the impassable wall block, fairway the corridor,
;;             tee the start cell, hole the cup. The same map backs
;;             config.assetManifest.terrains and every tile's terrainSprite
;;             in config.holes (url-only Assets, no atlas/sprite fields).
;;   Units     units/ball.svg + .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1}.svg frames —
;;             animations come from ball.md's states declaration
;;             ({ idle: 4, walk: 2 }); "walk" is the roll wobble.
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg (shell + HUD background — WIRED but a
;;             substrate no-op today: game-shell's AtlasPanel only slices
;;             atlas/spritesheet assets and silently drops url-only svg,
;;             so the texture never renders or fetches; gap recorded in
;;             Almadar_UI_Gaps.md by earlier waves), HUD stat icons
;;             ui/icon-{hole,strokes,par,total}.svg, button icons
;;             ui/icon-{next,reset}.svg, and d-pad key prompts
;;             ui/key-{up,down,left,right}.svg — all hand-authored on the
;;             shared cream-badge panel preset. Zero sprite-pack refs board-wide.
;; ============================================================================

orbital MinigolfBoardOrbital {
  type MinigolfBoardError = {
    message : string!
    name : string
    code : string
    stack : string
  }
  type Asset = {
      url : asset
      atlas : asset
      sprite : string
      role : string
      category : string
      animations : [string]
      style : string
      variant : string
      dimension : string
      aspect : string
      name : string
      thumbnailUrl : string
    }
  type MinigolfBoardTilesItem = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    type : string
    terrainSprite : Asset
    passable : boolean
    movementCost : number
    tileType : string
    elevation : number
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type MinigolfBoardUnitsItem = {
    id : string!
    position : MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPosition
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    sprite : Asset
    modelUrl : Asset
    unitType : string
    heroId : string
    name : string
    team : "player" | "enemy" | "neutral"
    faction : "player" | "enemy" | "neutral"
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    traits : [MinigolfBoardUnitsItemTraitsItem]
    previousPosition : MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPreviousPosition
    elevation : number
    animation : string
    frame : number
  }
  type MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type MinigolfBoardUnitsItemTraitsItem = {
    name : string!
    currentState : string!
    states : [string]!
    cooldown : number!
  }
  type MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPreviousPosition = {
    x : number!
    y : number!
  }
  type MinigolfBoardAssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }
  type MinigolfBoardHolesItem = {
    number : number!
    par : number!
    ballStart : MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPosition
    holeCell : MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPosition
    tiles : [MinigolfBoardTilesItem]
  }

  entity MinigolfBoardItem [runtime] {
    id : string!
    hole : number = 1
    strokes : number = 0
    total : number = 0
    totalPar : number = 0
    par : number = 3
    result : "none" | "complete" | "final" = none
    units : [MinigolfBoardUnitsItem]
    tiles : [MinigolfBoardTilesItem]
    holeCell : MinigolfBoardUnitsItemPosition = { x: 0, y: 0 }
    gridWidth : number = 8
    gridHeight : number = 6
  }

  trait MinigolfBoardRender -> @rebindable MinigolfBoardItem [interaction, instance] {
    initial: playing

    state playing {
      INIT -> playing
        (let ((h (array/find @config.holes (fn ho (== @ho.number 1)))))
          (do
            (set @entity.hole 1)
            (set @entity.strokes 0)
            (set @entity.total 0)
            (set @entity.totalPar 0)
            (set @entity.par (object/get @h par))
            (set @entity.tiles (object/get @h tiles))
            (set @entity.holeCell (object/get @h holeCell))
            (set @entity.units [ { id: "ball", position: (object/get @h ballStart), modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/units/ball.svg", role: "npc", category: "ball", animations: ["idle","walk"], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "ball", thumbnailUrl: "" }, unitType: "ball", name: "Ball", team: "player", animation: "idle", frame: 0 } ])
            (set @entity.gridWidth 8)
            (set @entity.gridHeight 6)
            (set @entity.result "none")))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Hole", value: @entity.hole, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-hole.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-hole", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Strokes", value: @entity.strokes, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-strokes.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-strokes", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Par", value: @entity.par, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-par.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-par", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Total", value: @entity.total, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-total.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-total", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          controls: { type: control-grid, kind: "dpad", directionEvents: { up: "PUTT_UP", down: "PUTT_DOWN", left: "PUTT_LEFT", right: "PUTT_RIGHT" }, directionAssets: { up: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-up.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-up", thumbnailUrl: "" }, down: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-down.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-down", thumbnailUrl: "" }, left: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-left.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-left", thumbnailUrl: "" }, right: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-right.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-right", thumbnailUrl: "" } } }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: false, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, keyMap: { ArrowUp: "PUTT_UP", KeyW: "PUTT_UP", ArrowDown: "PUTT_DOWN", KeyS: "PUTT_DOWN", ArrowLeft: "PUTT_LEFT", KeyA: "PUTT_LEFT", ArrowRight: "PUTT_RIGHT", KeyD: "PUTT_RIGHT" }, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (if (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (object/get @u modelUrl) (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) (object/get @u unitType))) { url: (if (== (object/get @u animation) "walk") (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/units/ball.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/units/ball.idle-" (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4)) ".svg")) }), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "center", width: 0.35, height: 0.35 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      PUTT_UP -> playing when (== @entity.result "none")
        (let ((ballPos (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id "ball"))) position)))
          (let ((rolled (array/reduce [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] { x: (object/get @ballPos x), y: (object/get @ballPos y), moving: true } (fn acc step (if (== (object/get @acc moving) false) @acc (let ((nx (+ (object/get @acc x) 0)) (ny (+ (object/get @acc y) -1))) (let ((inBounds (grid/in-bounds { x: @nx, y: @ny } @entity.gridWidth @entity.gridHeight)) (tile (array/find @entity.tiles (fn t (and (== (object/get @t x) @nx) (== (object/get @t y) @ny)))))) (if (and @inBounds (if (== @tile null) false (object/get @tile passable))) { x: @nx, y: @ny, moving: true } (object/merge @acc { moving: false })))))))))
            (do
              (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (object/merge @u { position: { x: (object/get @rolled x), y: (object/get @rolled y) }, animation: "walk", frame: 0 }))))
              (set @entity.strokes (+ @entity.strokes 1))
              (if (and (== (object/get @rolled x) (object/get @entity.holeCell x)) (== (object/get @rolled y) (object/get @entity.holeCell y)))
                (do
                  (set @entity.total (+ @entity.total @entity.strokes))
                  (set @entity.totalPar (+ @entity.totalPar @entity.par))
                  (set @entity.result (if (== @entity.hole 3) "final" "complete"))
                  (emit HOLE_IN))
                true))))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
          backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Hole", value: @entity.hole, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-hole.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-hole", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Strokes", value: @entity.strokes, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-strokes.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-strokes", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Par", value: @entity.par, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-par.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-par", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { label: "Total", value: @entity.total, iconUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-total.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-total", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ] }
          controls: { type: control-grid, kind: "dpad", directionEvents: { up: "PUTT_UP", down: "PUTT_DOWN", left: "PUTT_LEFT", right: "PUTT_RIGHT" }, directionAssets: { up: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-up.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-up", thumbnailUrl: "" }, down: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-down.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-down", thumbnailUrl: "" }, left: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-left.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-left", thumbnailUrl: "" }, right: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/ui/key-right.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "pixel", variant: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "key-right", thumbnailUrl: "" } } }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, camera: { zoom: @config.scale }, projection: "isometric", showMinimap: false, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, keyMap: { ArrowUp: "PUTT_UP", KeyW: "PUTT_UP", ArrowDown: "PUTT_DOWN", KeyS: "PUTT_DOWN", ArrowLeft: "PUTT_LEFT", KeyA: "PUTT_LEFT", ArrowRight: "PUTT_RIGHT", KeyD: "PUTT_RIGHT" }, children: [
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get @t terrainSprite) })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), asset: (object/merge (if (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (object/get @u modelUrl) (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) (object/get @u unitType))) { url: (if (== (object/get @u animation) "walk") (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/units/ball.walk-" (% (object/get @u frame) 2)) ".svg") (str/concat (str/concat "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-minigolf-board/svg/isometric/units/ball.idle-" (% (math/floor (/ (object/get @u frame) 3)) 4)) ".svg")) }), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "center", width: 0.35, height: 0.35 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.units (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      PUTT_DOWN -> playing when (== @entity.result "none")
        (let ((ballPos (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id "ball"))) position)))
          (let ((rolled (array/reduce [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] { x: (object/get @ballPos x), y: (object/get @ballPos y), moving: true } (fn acc step (if (== (object/get @acc moving) false) @acc (let ((nx (+ (object/get @acc x) 0)) (ny (+ (object/get @acc y) 1))) (let ((inBounds (grid/in-bounds { x: @nx, y: @ny } @entity.gridWidth @entity.gridHeight)) (tile (array/find @entity.tiles (fn t (and (== (object/get @t x) @nx) (== (object/get @t y) @ny)))))) (if (and @inBounds (if (== @tile null) false (object/get @tile passable))) { x: @nx, y: @ny, moving: true } (object/merge @acc { moving: false })))))))))
            (do
              (set @entity.units (array/map @entity.units (fn u (object/merge @u { position: { x: (object/get @rolled x), y: (object/get @rolled y) }, animation: "walk", frame: 0 }))))
              (set @entity.strokes (+ @entity.strokes 1))
              (if (and (== (object/get @rolled x) (object/get @entity.holeCell x)) (== (object/get @rolled y) (object/get @entity.holeCell y)))
                (do
                  (set @entity.total (+ @entity.total @entity.strokes))
                  (set @entity.totalPar (+ @entity.totalPar @entity.par))
                  (set @entity.result (if (== @entity.hole 3) "final" "complete"))
                  (emit HOLE_IN))
                true))))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          fontFamily: "future"
